    "name": "10K Training: Novice",
    "author": "Hal Higdon",
    "version": "1.0",
    "created_at": null,
    "description": "HOW MUCH DO YOU NEED TO TRAIN TO RUN 10K? If you possess a good level of fitness (because of participation in other sports) you probably could run a half dozen miles on very little training. That might include running shorter races, such as a 5K or an 8K. But if you've made the decision ... Continue reading \"Novice\"",
