        "description": "On the schedule, this is identified simply as \"cross.\" Wednesdays and Saturdays are cross-training days: swimming, cycling, walking, cross-country skiing, snowshoeing, or other forms of aerobic training. But don't cross-train too vigorously. Cross-training days should be easy days.",
